<title>USA: Buckle March same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Buckle March same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>KEARNEY, Neb. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buckle Inc said Thursday that same-store sales for the five weeks ended April 5 rose 12.9 percent from the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Total sales increased 23.6 percent, to $20.8 million from $16.8 million.  </p>
<p>Net sales year-to-date for the nine weeks ended April 5 increased 21.2 percent from a year ago, to $34.2 million from $28.2 million. Comparable-store sales year-to-date were up 11.1 percent.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
